You enter an aggressive battle stance, increasing Accuracy by [20, 27, 32, 36, 40 (TL1-5; STR 100; DEX 100)] and Physical Power by [20, 27, 32, 36, 40 (TL1-5; STR 100; DEX 100)], at the cost of -10 Defense and -10 Armour.

While berserking, you are nearly unstoppable, granting you [18%, 28%, 35%, 40%, 44% (TL1-5)] stun and pinning resistance.

The Accuracy bonus increases with your Dexterity, and the Physical Power bonus with your Strength.
